OL,3,GNEWSALidl wins town's battle of the
OL,4,AGerman supermarkets
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad concerns gave one German
OL,7,Fsupermarket chain the edge over a rival
OL,8,Fas planners considered two applications
OL,9,Ffor new stores in the same town.
OL,11,FNorth Norfolk District Council has
OL,12,Fgranted Lidl approval to build a store
OL,13,Fin Holt, off Nightjar Way, just off the
OL,14,FA148.
OL,16,FHowever, councillors turned down an
OL,17,Fapplication for an Aldi supermarket
OL,18,Fabout 800 metres (0.5 miles) away on
OL,19,FOld Station Way, due to "highways
OL,20,Finfrastructural concerns".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
