OL,3,GNEWSALidl wins town's battle of the
OL,4,AGerman supermarkets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council received 228
OL,7,Frepresentations from the public in
OL,8,Frelation to the Lidl plans, of which
OL,9,F186 were positive. Councillors welcomed
OL,10,Fthe prospect of 40 jobs coming to the
OL,11,Ftown.
